  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf2d7532251303545ab78ab68b00d5cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequenceId: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation
  notes: '17F01 morning parent observation. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_No_Audio_Tags_Native_English.md,
    stable marker 17F01_LivingRoomObservation. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Daniel
    text: Noah had a nightmare last night?
    holdSeconds: 3.414151
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Emily
    text: He did? He didn't come get us.
    holdSeconds: 3.7915094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Daniel
    text: Huh.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Emily
    text: Then I guess the unit handled it.
    holdSeconds: 3.7915094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Daniel
    text: Yeah.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Emily
    text: It's kind of strange, though.
    holdSeconds: 3.0367923
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Daniel
    text: What is?
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Emily
    text: He used to knock on our door after every bad dream. I got used to him waking
      us up. But lately... I haven't heard him knock once.
    holdSeconds: 11.338679
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Daniel
    text: Isn't that a good thing? He's getting older, and we get a full night's
      sleep.
    holdSeconds: 6.810377
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Emily
    text: But he hasn't told us about a dream in... God, when was the last time?
      I can't even remember. I think it's been a year.
    holdSeconds: 10.5839615
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Daniel
    text: He was seven, Em. Seven-year-olds tell you everything. He's almost nine
      now. He's got his own little world.
    holdSeconds: 7.9424524
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Emily
    text: Yeah, but...
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Daniel
    text: Hey. At least we're not up at two in the morning anymore, right?
    holdSeconds: 6.0556602
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Emily
    text: Right.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
